msgid "AUTO"
msgstr "AUTO"

msgid "AX3048510YC14. 찾을 수 없을 거라고 생각한다. 하지만 찾는다면 나한테 어느 정도의 보상은 되겠지. 정말 잊을 수 없는 번호다. 처음엔 잊어서 수첩을 파헤쳐야 했지만 말이다."
msgstr "AX3048510YC14... why can't I quit you? All the pain, the literal trials and tribulations, I know it would all be worth it if I ever found you. But I don't have time to write down my complaints today. Therapy awaits... and it's pizza night."

msgid "AX3048510YC14. 평생 잊을 수 없는 중요한 번호다."
msgstr "AX3048510YC14. These are the numbers I will remember forever."

msgid "A가 남긴 기록"
msgstr "A's Records"

msgid "A가 남긴 기록이 있더라고 하더라. 넌 그걸 본 거겠지."
msgstr "Oh, I think you know. A left an interesting memo behind. I'm sure you've seen it."

msgid "A가 죽었을 때 K는 어려서 기억을 못 할 거야."
msgstr "K is probably too young to remember when A died."

msgid "A는 기억이 잘 안 나요. A가 죽었을 때 이모가 울었던 건 생각이 나네요."
msgstr "The only thing I remember about A is how Auntie cried when she heard the news."

msgid "A는 나중에 망상 증세가 심해져서, 사람들이 자기를 죽이려 한다고 생각했어. 제때 치료할 기회가 없었지."
msgstr "A's hallucinations only grew worse. She progressed to the point that she thought somebody was trying to kill her. We couldn't help her—not until it was too late."

msgid "A는 매력적인 사람이었어. 원래 정보기관에서 일했고, 휴가 중에 듀랑고로 떨어졌지."
msgstr "A was a charismatic woman who worked at an intelligence agency. She was on vacation when the Warp brought her to Durango."

msgid "A는 어떻게든 자기가 이곳에 있는 이유를 만들어야 했어. 내가 많이 도왔지만, 환청에서 빠져 나오게 할 수가 없었어."
msgstr "A needed a way to make sense of how she ended up here. She concocted a whole fantasy, but eventually lost track of what was real and what was part of her own sick invention. We tried to help, but we just became part of the conspiracy for her."

msgid "A는 회사가 듀랑고에 특수한 임무로 파견된 정보기관이라고 설정을 했어. 그리고 진짜로 그걸 믿어 버리게 됐지."
msgstr "A pretended the Company was an intelligence agency dispatched to Durango for a special mission. She knew it wasn't true, right up until she didn't."

msgid "A도 보안을 우려해서, 절대 한 자료로 이해할 수 없게 꼬아놨더라고."
msgstr "Even A knew how important it was to keep that information secure, and so she made her entire report cryptic and hard to understand."

msgid "A를 기억할 거라곤 생각 안 했는데 기억하고 있었구나. 똑똑하기도 하지."
msgstr "I honestly thought you'd forgotten A, but it was all an act... How clever!"

msgid "A를 죽였어?"
msgstr "Did they kill A?"

