msgstr "There is no information on the {id} crop."

msgid "{id}: 유효하지 않은 이용권입니다."
msgstr "{id}: Invalid voucher."

msgid "{invitee} 님을 초대했습니다."
msgstr "{invitee} was invited."

msgid "{invitee} 님이 파티 초대를 거절했습니다."
msgstr "{invitee} declined the party invitation."

msgid "{item:을} 건조한 것. \"시간은 수명과 물기를 가져간다.\""
msgstr "{item} is dried. \"If only some moisturizer would fall through the Warp...\""

msgid "{item:을} 구웠는데 설익었다. \"땅에다 심으면 자라겠군.\""
msgstr "{item} is undercooked. \"So underdone, you might as well replant it.\""

msgid "{item:을} 구웠는데 설익었다. \"한 번 더 구웠으면 좋겠다.\""
msgstr "{item} is undercooked. \"Just throw it in the microw—oh...\""

msgid "{item:을} 국 끓인 것. \"속이 따뜻해질 거야.\""
msgstr "{item} soup. \"Just like mom used to make.\""

msgid "{item:을} 금속 석쇠에 구운 것. \"자랑할 데가 없다는 게 아쉽다.\""
msgstr "{item} was grilled on a metal grate. \"If only this could be shared on social media...\""

msgid "{item:을} 금속 석쇠에 구운 것. 탔다. \"안타까워라.\""
msgstr "{item} was grilled on a metal grate. It's burnt. \"A great tragedy of our times.\""

msgid "{item:을} 길들였다. 귀속할 수 있다."
msgstr "{item} has been tamed. You can now form a bond with it."

msgid "{item:을} 다듬은 것. \"자신을 버리지 마라. 견디면 시간이 다듬어준다.\""
msgstr "Trimmed {item}. \"Just a little off the sides.\""

msgid "{item:을} 다지고 뭉친 환약. \"고급 환약은 건강 보험 비급여 대상이다.\""
msgstr "Pill made by grinding and pressing {item}. \"Quality pills are not covered by insurance.\""

msgid "{item:을} 다지고 뭉친 환약. \"누구나 아픈 날이 있다.\""
msgstr "Pill made by grinding and pressing {item}. \"A pill every day keeps the doctor well-paid!\""

msgid "{item:을} 다지고 뭉친 환약. \"죽음을 피할 순 없지만 늦출 순 있다.\""
msgstr "Pill made by grinding and pressing {item}. \"Death cannot be stopped...but it can be distracted.\""

msgid "{item:을} 덜 말린 것. \"시간이 충분하지 않을 때도 있다.\""
msgstr "{item} is partly dried. \"Some things just need more time.\""

msgid "{item:을} 돌판에 구운 것. \"죽기 전에 다시 먹고 싶을 것 같다.\""
msgstr "{item} was grilled on a stone plate. \"I hope I can eat it at least one more time before I die.\""

msgid "{item:을} 돌판에 구운 것. 탔다. \"너무 신중했던 것 같다.\""
msgstr "{item} was grilled on a stone plate. It's burnt. \"Patience: not always a virtue.\""

msgid "{item:을} 로스트한 것. \"인생에 더 나은 게 있나?\""
msgstr "{item} was roasted. \"Tell me: What's better than this?\""

msgid "{item:을} 로스트한 것. 탔다. \"되돌리고 싶은 순간이 있다.\""
msgstr "{item} was roasted. It's burnt. \"If I could turn back time... If I could find a way...\""

msgid "{item:을} 말린 것. \"냉장고 이전의 조상들은 고생했구나.\""
msgstr "{item} is dried. \"Who needs a fridge?\""

msgid "{item:을} 말린 것. \"물기 없는 과일도 별미다.\""
msgstr "{item} is dried. \"None of the moisture, all of the flavor.\""

msgid "{item:을} 무두질한 것. \"쓸모가 있으려면 꽤 많은 시도가 필요하다.\""
msgstr "Tanned {item}. \"Only time will show us its purpose.\""

msgid "{item:을} 묶어 이은 끈. \"길이가 등차수열이면, 쓸모는 등비수열이다.\""
msgstr "{item} connected by a strap. \"The only thing better than a strap is a longer strap.\""

msgid "{item:을} 볶은 것. \"불맛이 배이면 다 그럴싸하다.\""
msgstr "Stir-fried {item}. \"Most things can be fixed with fire, you just have to get a little creative sometimes.\""

msgid "{item:을} 삶은 것. \"삶은 그대로도 아름다운 것.\""
msgstr "Simmered {item}. \"Life is beautiful even when it's boring.\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 금속 석쇠에 구운 것. \"이걸 만든 것만으로도 인간은 살 가치가 있다.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and grilled on a metal grate. \"The fact that people can create such a dish is reason enough to save humanity.\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 금속 석쇠에 구운 것. 탔다. \"욕심을 부렸나보다.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and grilled on a metal grate. It's burnt. \"The sickest burn.\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 돌판에 구운 것. \"돌판구이가 맛있단 느낌만은 영원할 것 같다.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and grilled on a stone plate. \"Just like the Fourth of July!\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 돌판에 구운 것. 탔다. \"타임머신이 필요해.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and grilled on a stone plate. It's burnt. \"If only I had a time machine...\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 로스트한 것. \"어디서나 일용할 양식을.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and roasted. \"Give us this day our daily bread.\""

msgid "{item:을} 양념 발라 로스트한 것. 탔다. \"자신을 과신했던 것 같다.\""
msgstr "{item} was seasoned and roasted. It's burnt. \"I prefer 'very well done,' thank you.\""

msgid "{item:을} 연장한 막대. \"연장 근무보단 연장한 막대가 행복하리라.\""
msgstr "Stick extended from {item}. \"Much better than extended work hours.\""

msgid "{item:을} 염장한 것. \"내일 먹을 게 있다는 게 기쁘다.\""
msgstr "{item} is preserved with salt. \"Why eat today what you can save for tomorrow?\""

msgid "{item:을} 염장한 것. 향을 넣었다. \"먹고 마시고 개척하라.\""
msgstr "{item} is flavored and preserved with salt. \"Eat, drink, and pioneer!\""

msgid "{item:을} 오랜 시간 구워 육즙이 살아있다."
msgstr "{item} is still juicy from being slow cooked."

msgid "{item:을} 우린 차. \"새로운 다도를 세울 때가 왔다.\""
msgstr "{item} steeped tea. \"It's time we come up with a new tea ceremony.\""

msgid "{item:을} 잘 구웠다. \"이런 걸 보니 살아 있는 것 같다.\""
msgstr "{item} is well cooked. \"What a time to be alive.\""

msgid "{item:을} 잘 구웠다. \"잘 먹고 치과의사를 찾아야겠다.\""
msgstr "{item} is well cooked. \"Food first, dentist later! Or, you know, never.\""

msgid "{item:을} 제대로 통조림한 것. \"이곳에 회사 하나 차리고 싶다.\""
msgstr "{item} is canned properly. \"To think our cheapest foods would become a high cuisine.\""

msgid "{item:을} 찐 것. \"증기로 푹 익혔다.\""
msgstr "{item} was steamed. \"And not in the sense that it's angry.\""

msgid "{item:을} 태웠다. \"불조절이 쉬운 건 아니다.\""
msgstr "{item} is burnt. \"Play with fire and you're going to get a subpar dish.\""

msgid "{item:을} 통조림한 것. \"많은 기술을 복기해본다.\""
msgstr "{item} is canned. \"Some basic skills have become a lost art.\""

msgid "{item:을} 튀긴 것. \"행복은 기름의 손을 잡고 온다.\""
msgstr "Fried {item}. \"Everything tastes better fried.\""

msgid "{item:을} 향을 넣어 말린 것. \"마른 것이시여 만수무강하소서.\""
msgstr "{item} was dried with added flavor. \"May it last an eternity.\""

msgid "{item:을} 향을 넣어 말린 것. \"생존이 해결되면 다음 문제는 취향이다.\""
msgstr "{item} was dried with added flavor. \"We'll start considering preference after we figure out how to survive.\""

msgid "{item:을} 훈제한 것. \"여기서 여러 요리법을 겪어 본다.\""
msgstr "{item} is smoked. \"Who knew you could prepare a single meal in so many ways?\""

msgid "{item:을} 훈제한 것. 향을 넣었다. \"지쳤다면 앉아서 식감을 즐겨보자.\""
msgstr "{item} was smoked with added flavor. \"Sit down, kick back, and dig in. You've earned it.\""

