msgstr "Metal mixed with {item} and other metals. Breaks easily."

msgid "{item}에 가죽을 덮은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} wrapped with leather. \"I though 'tastes like leather' was just a turn-of-phrase...\""

msgid "{item}에 고기를 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} garnished with meat. \"Everything tastes better with a little dash of cooked animal byproducts.\""

msgid "{item}에 깃털을 덧댄 것. \"인간은 제모를 하고 남의 털을 걸친다.\""
msgstr "{item} covered with feathers. \"Think this will let it fly?\""

msgid "{item}에 뭔가를 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} coated with...something. \"When I said I wanted a bit of danger in my life, this wasn't what I had in mind.\""

msgid "{item}에 벌레를 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} garnished with bugs. \"Gives new meaning to the phrase 'butterflies in your stomach,' doesn't it?\""

msgid "{item}에 생선을 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} topped with fish. \"I wonder how much this would have cost back on Earth...\""

msgid "{item}에 약재를 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} topped with medicinal herbs. \"If you try eating this raw, you'll get worse before you get better.\""

msgid "{item}에 연근을 얹은 찜. \"입은 날로 먹으려 하지만, 위는 그렇지 않다.\""
msgstr "Braised {item} garnished with lotus roots. \"Let's hope you don't find out you have trypophobia when you eat this.\""

msgid "{item}을 꼬치에 끼워 구운 것. \"이런걸 보니 살아있는 것 같다.\""
msgstr "Skewered {item} roasted over a fire. \"Everything tastes better on a stick.\""

