msgstr "When some crazy rumor seems useless or improbable, it means 628 is doing a good job. Right now, 628 is investing in a pseudo-scientist who claims <em>{item_1}s</em> that build their hives in <em>{item_0}s</em> can sense the Warp's magnetic field. The stranger, the better."

