msgid "겁도 없는 것들이 피아를 막 콕콕 찔러 보네요. 피아가 봐줘서 망정이지."
msgstr "They keep poking at Pia, trying to figure out what she is. Good thing for them she's letting it slide."

msgid "겁쟁이 랩터"
