msgstr "Grilled {item} Skewer"

msgid "구워낸 케이크. \"오늘도 누군가는 생일을 맞으리라.\""
msgstr "Baked cake. \"Sweet quiche, that's a tasty pastry!\""

msgid "구이 요리하기"
