msgid "기다리는 동안 다이어울프를 다룬 생물학 책을 찾아봤지. 괴팍한 습성에 관한 기록은 없던데 이참에 개정할 구석이 있겠어.  "
msgstr "While waiting around, I read through a biology book that had an entry on Direwolves. There was no mention of their foul temperament, so maybe I should edit that in..."

msgid "기다리는 동안 코엘로피시스를 다룬 생물학 책을 찾아봤지. 괴팍한 습성에 관한 기록은 없던데 이참에 개정할 구석이 있겠어.  "
msgstr "While waiting around, I read through a biology book that had an entry on Coelophysis. There was no mention of their foul temperament though... Perhaps I should make a note of it."

