msgid "대지강타의 피해량을 늘립니다."
msgstr "Increase the damage of Sunder."

msgid "대책 회의"
msgstr "Discussing Countermeasures"

msgid "대체 불가능 정도는?"
msgstr "This is going to be damn near impossible, isn't it?"

msgid "대추"
