msgstr "Salt derived from sea water. \"It's not Pink Himalayan, but it will have to do.\""

msgid "바닷물을 뿌려 플레이어 캐릭터를 씻긴다."
msgstr "Washes the player by splashing sea water on them."

msgid "바닷물이 워프된 것인지, 아니면 워프된 쓰레기를 버린 것인지 해안의 <em>{item_0}</em> 주변에 <em>{item_1}</em>가 나올 때가 있습니다. 수거하여 주변 환경에 미칠 악영향을 줄여주신다면 정말 감사할 것 같습니다."
msgstr "We don't know if the trash simply warped in on the coast or if people here dumped it into the sea... In either case, it looks like <em>{item_1}s</em> have recently been appearing amongst shoals of <em>{item_0}</em>. We'd be thankful if you could pick them up before they have an adverse effect on the environment."

