msgid "바빠서 일일이 볼 수가 없었어. 애들도 아팠고."
msgstr "No. I had a lot on my plate, and my kids were sick."

msgid "바쁩니까? 선생님은 뭔가 얘기가 통할 것 같아서 말이에요."
msgstr "Do you have time for a short chat? I'm sure you, of all people, will be able to understand what I have to say."

