msgid "발신기 신호 들어야 할 당직자 놈이 처자느라 24시간이나 늦게 발견했어. 암호관도 버벅거려서 5시간을 더 썼고. 둥지는 기강이 해이해. 물량이 10톤 정도 되는데 작전물자는 2톤 밖에 안 돼."
msgstr "I found it 24 hours late because the idiot who's supposed to be listening to transmissions fell asleep at the console. I wasted 5 more hours after that thanks to a dim-witted codebreaker. I'm telling you, the discipline of the Nest could use some serious work. The supplies weigh 10 tons, but only 2 tons are for the operation."

