msgstr "That last transmission... It seemed like whoever was speaking wanted us to hear it."

msgid "방금 무슨 소리 들리지 않았니?"
msgstr "Hey, did you hear that? Sounded like..."

msgid "방금 무전하는 동안 <em>컨시어지</em>가 어디있는지 파악해 두었어. "
msgstr "But there's also some good news. Remember that transmission a bit ago? I used it to figure out the <em>Concierge</em>'s location."

msgid "방금 빛이 번쩍했는데 워프 현상이었겠죠. 실종된 아내의 흔적이 항구 근처에서 사라졌어요."
msgstr "That bright light... Must have been another Warp. The missing wife's trail suddenly ends near the harbor."

msgid "방금 워프가 일어난 섬이 있어요. <em>현장 확인</em>부터 부탁할게요."
msgstr "A big Warp hit an island not too far from here. I want you to go <em>check it out</em>."

