msgstr "Flour made out of barley. \"The ability to grind barley into flour was cutting edge technology once. Shame it still is.\""

msgid "보리를 재배할 수 있는 종자이다.. \"이 작은 씨앗은 싹을 틔워 겨울을 견딜 끈기가 있다.\""
msgstr "Seed for growing barley. \"This small seed has the persistence to sprout and survive. Just like you.\""

msgid "보리반죽으로 만든 꽃전. \"꽃장식이 이뻐서 손을 대기 어렵다.\" 보리 향이 구수하다."
msgstr "A flower cake made out of barley dough. \"Flowers are so pretty, it's a shame you have to eat them.\" The scent of barley surrounds it."

