msgid "불타는 파고다 사우나"
msgstr "Burning Pagoda Sauna"

msgid "불타버린 숲"
msgstr "Burnt Forest"

msgid "불행한 일이야. 그땐 지금보다 더 열악했거든."
msgstr "It's truly unfortunate. As bad as things are now, the situation was so much worse back then."

msgid "불확실성과 친분"
msgstr "Questions and Colleagues"

msgid "붉게 물든 페나코두스를 보고 말이야. 우두머리 페나코들이 도망을 갔단다."
msgstr "The head Phenacodus ran away after seeing one of his comrades painted red."

msgid "붉고 매끄러운 가죽"
msgstr "Slick Red Leather"

msgid "붉은 매화"
msgstr "Red Ume"

