msgstr "Necklace made out of a Brachio's tooth. \"Who knew herbivores could produce such stylish accessories?\""

msgid "브라키오 이빨로 목걸이를 만든다. 목걸이를 착용하면 최대 체력이 증가한다."
msgstr "Necklace made of a Brachio tooth. Increases Max HP when equipped."

