msgstr "I have a few biology books, but some of them are now out of date. For instance, on page 331 of the book I'm currently reading..."

msgid "생물학과 표본 채집에 관심이 많아 책도 읽고 현장 실습도 다닌다."
msgstr "Driven to read a lot and perform field experiments by a personal interest in the collection of biological specimens."

