msgid "송곳잡이 밑에서 비서하던 그 은발 기억나? 이름이 생각이 안 나네. 그 은발이 죽었대. 바람 피우다가 걸렸는데 갑자기 쓰러졌대. 회의 때마다 개거물처럼 굴더니 죽을 땐 옹졸하게 죽었지."
msgstr "Do you remember the old graybeard who used to work as a secretary for the awl handler? His name escapes me... Well, he's dead now. His wife caught him fooling around and stabbed him in his sleep. It's almost funny—I always remember him acting like such a big shot in meetings. Not such a big shot now."

