msgstr "Canteen"

msgid "수통의 물은 더위를 이기는데\n도움이 됩니다."
msgstr "Keeping a canteen full of water\nis a good way to beat the heat."

msgid "수폴스"
msgstr "Sioux Falls"

msgid "수풀에서 사라진 기술자들의 흔적을 찾아줘."
msgstr "I want you to find any trace of the engineers who disappeared near the thicket."

msgid "수확 가능"
msgstr "Available to Harvest"

msgid "수확 예상량"
msgstr "Expected Harvest Amount"

msgid "수확 퀘스트"
msgstr "Harvest Task"

msgid "수확까지"
msgstr "Until Harvest"

msgid "수확량"
msgstr "Harvest"

msgid "수확하기"
msgstr "The Harvest"

msgid "수확한 벚꽃과 겹벚꽃을 이용하여 벚꽃길을 건설해 보세요."
msgstr "Use harvested cherry blossoms and donarium cherry blossoms to build cherry blossom roads."

msgid "수후미"
msgstr "Sukhumi"

msgid "숙련 농사도구 요청"
msgstr "Intermediate Farming Tool Request"

msgid "숙련 무기부품 요청"
msgstr "Intermediate Weapon Part Request"

msgid "숙련 요리도구 요청"
