msgstr "Seed for growing corn. Suitable for small fields. \"Corn will eventually dominate every concession stand in Durango.\""

msgid "옥수수를 얻을 수 있는 종자. 작은 밭이나 화단에 심어 키운다. \"극장이 생기려면 많이 남았다.\""
msgstr "Grows corn. Suitable for flower beds and small fields. \"Corn will eventually dominate every concession stand in Durango.\""

msgid "옥수수와 채소를 섞은 요리. \"삶은 유한하나, 다이어트는 영원하다.\""
msgstr "Salad with corn and vegetables. \"Life is temporary, but diets... Well, I guess those are even more temporary.\""

