msgstr "Wooden pot for cooking. \"You'd think it would just burn, but you'd be wrong!\""

msgid "요리에 쓰는 나무 도마. \"날카롭게 내리쳐도 다 받아준다.\""
msgstr "Wooden cutting board for cooking. \"Stops any blade. Why don't people wear this as armor?\""

