msgstr "Overexerted"

msgid "운동복"
msgstr "Tracksuit"

msgid "운동복 외형장비"
msgstr "Tracksuit (Decorative)"

msgid "운동복을 개조한 옷. \"운명은 부르지 않고, 오길 기다린다.\""
msgstr "Modified clothing worn to play sports. \"Destiny is like that crush you've had since elementary school: it waits for you to make the first move.\""

msgid "운동화"
msgstr "Running Shoes"

msgid "운송 능력"
msgstr "Transportation Ability"

msgid "운송로에서 징집자를 병들지 않게, 굶주리지 않게, 다치지 않게 데려가는 과정에 적극 참여하는 것은 나의 마지막 양심일까? 성실하게 직무를 수행하는 부역 행위일까? 대답하기 어렵다. 식량과 약품을 준비하는 건 결국 무법섬으로 사람을 데려가기 위한 것이다."
msgstr "Sometimes I wonder if my enthusiasm for ensuring the recruits don't starve or succumb to injury while traveling along our transportation routes is my last shred of humanity. Or maybe it's simply doing my job... Hard to say. In the end, the food and medicine is just another part of trafficking people to Savage Islands."

msgid "운수 나쁜 트리케라톱스."
msgstr "Some Unlucky Triceratops"

msgid "운수 좋은 날."
msgstr "Three Horns Are Not a Charm"

msgid "운영 담당인 사와라트 선생이 말하는 운동은 취지는 좋습니다."
msgstr "Sawarat is in charge of operations. I assure you she has the best of intentions."

