msgid "웃기는. 다른 사람들은 잘 있지?"
msgstr "You're very welcome. How are the others? Well, I hope."

msgid "워낙 사람이 마음이 강해서 어찌 더 말을 못 하겠더라고."
msgstr "He deflected most of my other questions. \"Stubborn\" only begins to describe his attitude."

msgid "워낙 이해관계가 복잡하게 얽혀있는 일이라서 결국 폭력 사태까지 오고 말았군요."
msgstr "Seems like a dispute between some of the groups turned violent. We need to figure out who's turning people against each other, and fast..."

msgid "워낙에 섬이 흩어져 있다 보니까 어디에 자리를 잡는 게 어려운 겨."
msgstr "The scattered islands make it difficult to find the perfect location."

