msgstr "Check Expected Results if you're nervous about your crafting.\nYou can even view the Flawless Rate."

msgid "제작 과정에서 도구라고 명시된 것은 제작 후에\n재료처럼 사라지지 않고 대신 내구도가 감소합니다."
msgstr "Items used as tools during the crafting process\nwill not disappear like materials, but they will lose Durability."

