msgid "청소부 앤드류사르쿠스를 사냥해주십시오. 그리고 뱃속을 들여다 봅시다."
msgstr "Hunt the Scavenger Andrewsarchus and check their stomachs. I know it's grisly work, but it's the only way we'll know."

msgid "청진"
msgstr "Chongjin"

msgid "체념은 최고의 동력원이다.\n아침마다 지구의 가족을 생각하면서도,\n점심 때는 새로 쓸 사냥 장비의 경제성을 논한다."
msgstr "Accepting reality is essential. \nYou might miss your family back on Earth when you open your eyes each morning, but by noon you'd best be busy crafting or hunting, or you may as well be busy dying."

