msgid "추가 효과 없음"
msgstr "No Additional Effect"

msgid "추가할 이름을 적어주세요"
msgstr "Enter the name you want to add"

msgid "추락 현장을 벗어나자 물살이 센 하천이 나왔다.\n벌거벗은 채 뛰어들었다.\n나는 완전히 자유다. 스스로 존재하는 인간이 되리라.\n나오자 빨래를 든 사람들이 노려 보았다."
msgstr "I wandered from the crash site and into a torrential river. I dove into its cold, coursing embrace.\nI was naked. I was free. Finally, I had found myself, the real me.\nWhen I turned around, I discovered people had been glaring at me the whole time as they finished their laundry."

