msgstr "Fur"

msgid "털 달고 어찌 덥게 열대에 사는지 알아봤는데, 몸에 <em>워프 에너지</em>의 흔적이 있다는 겨."
msgstr "I went to investigate how they endured the tropical heat given their thick fur, and it turns out their bodies are riddles with traces of <em>Warp energy</em>!"

