msgid "포유류인 스밀로돈을 보면 반갑긴 하지만\n생물계통이 정치적 동맹을 뜻하진 않는다."
msgstr "It's almost comforting to behold a sabertooth, since they look like big kitty cats.\nHowever, plenty have found out the hard way that a creature can look cuddly, and be anything but your friend."

