msgid "플레이어의 요청에 의해 만료된 상품({product_id})에 포함된 아이템({item_names})이 {seller_entity_id} 님의 인벤토리로 반환됨"
msgstr "Due to the player's request, the item ({item_names}) included in the expired product ({product_id}) was returned to {seller_entity_id}'s inventory."

