msgid "피로도를 낮춰주는 전통 음료. \"인생은 짧고 식혜는 달다.\""
msgstr "Traditional Korean drink that lowers Fatigue. \"This delicious beverage was called Sikhye back on Earth.\""

msgid "피로를 1000 줄여주는 음료수. \"과잉 섭취시 부작용에 유의하세요.\""
msgstr "Drink that reduces Fatigue by 1,000. \"Warning: Overdosing may have unintended side-effects.\""

msgid "피로를 1000 줄여주는 음료수. \"콤피와 함께 피로를 풀어주세요.\""
msgstr "Restorative drink that decreases Fatigue by 1,000. \"Compy can cure what ails ya!\""

msgid "피로를 1000 줄여주는 음료수. \"피로가 발목을 잡도록 방치하지 마세요.\""
msgstr "Restorative drink that decreases Fatigue by 1,000. \"Fatigue is just a state of mind. Rise above it.\""

msgid "피로를 300 줄여주는 음료수. \"과잉 섭취시 부작용에 유의하세요.\""
msgstr "Drink that reduces Fatigue by 300. \"Warning: Overdosing may have unintended side-effects.\""

msgid "피로를 300 줄여주는 음료수. \"금요일 저녁 같은 맛이다.\""
msgstr "Restorative drink that decreases Fatigue by 300. \"Tastes like a Friday night.\""

