msgstr "Thanks to your help, peace has returned to the camp. Looks like we owe you again."

msgid "힘쓰는 일에는 익숙하죠?"
msgstr "You're not bad at manual labor, right?"

msgid "힘을 비율로 올려준다"
msgstr "Increases your Strength proportionally."

msgid "힘을 올려준다"
